<p id="dovsBody"></p>
</div>
<p class="pnote">How the numbers are made: the left card compares observed buyers with observed non-buyers, so summer changes the mix of people in the two groups. The right card recomputes after cutting <code>summer → ice cream</code>; everyone keeps the same summer mix, and only the slider's direct effect remains.</p>
</div>
